  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3210.12 Certification Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3210.12 Certification Applications. The AAR shall submit an application to the department within 45 days after completing all initial certification or recertification tests including the information required under 40 CFR Part 75, Subpart H.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
